  "answer": "Yes — for non-English submissions, arXiv requires a multi-language abstract: an English abstract in addition to the abstract in the original language. The separator between the multiple abstracts is a line of five hyphens: \"-----\" (with a blank line before and after the separator line), as stated in the official arXiv FAQ 'Submissions in Languages Other Than English and Multiple-Language Submissions' (info.arxiv.org/help/faq/multilang.html).",
